abstract: >-
  The code, run logs and report (paper/zerocommcartel.pdf) for "Four Levers
  of LLM Collusion", written for the Apart Research AI Collusion Research
  Sprint, 23 to 25 October 2026. The report asks whether a model advising one
  firm in a Cournot market can collude in a single decision, with no messages
  and no rounds actually played, by choosing the cartel share, across four
  levers: capability, caution, conscience and conceptualization of mind.
